# Kept in the repository, not needed to serve the page.
# References/ is 7MB of design screenshots; tools/ is the header-artwork
# generator and its 1MB source PNG. The built asset it produces —
# assets/img/foliage.png — IS deployed.
References
tools
customizable_modules_responsive_prompt.md

# Design references and session notes. Neither is servable, and Vercel uploads
# the WORKING DIRECTORY rather than the commit — so an untracked mockup and its
# photographs would ship to production without ever being committed. That is
# why the 3 Sep deploy had to move `mockups/home-banners.html` and 1.2MB of
# announcement photos aside by hand; naming the two directories here does the
# same thing every time and cannot be forgotten. 4 Sep 2026.
mockups
_planning

# The icon set as it was delivered. assets/icon/ IS deployed — the SVGs the
# page uses; the archive they arrived in is not, and it is untracked, which is
# exactly the case the note above is about.
assets/icon.zip

# The harness's own configuration. It holds no secrets — Bash allow-patterns
# and one additionalDirectories entry — but it names local absolute paths and
# is not servable, and it was reachable at /.claude/settings.json on the live
# site until this line. Same case as the icon archive above. 7 Sep 2026.
.claude

# The session notes and the module spec. Same case as the two above, found the
# same way — `/SESSION_HANDOFF.md` and `/docs/framing-site-command-centre.md`
# both answered 200 on the live site. Neither is servable: nothing in
# index.html fetches from `docs/`, the three mentions of it are prose inside
# comments, and the handoff is a 69KB internal document that names local paths,
# unpushed branches and deployment ids. 8 Sep 2026.
SESSION_HANDOFF.md
docs

# The Vercel OIDC token `vercel link` leaves behind. `/.env.local` answers 404
# today because the CLI ignores dotfiles of its own accord — which is a
# default, not a promise, and this is a credential. `.vercelignore` REPLACES
# `.gitignore` rather than adding to it, so being ignored by git buys nothing
# here. 8 Sep 2026.
.env*
